        "name": "sn3ro",
        "email": "zak.darek@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-25T21:49:01Z"
      },
      "message": "refactor(ui): tool drawing inks are theme tokens\n\nThe tool, holder and profile previews, the library thumbnails, the\ntool body page and the refusal and warning text of the tool pages drew\nwith colour literals and module consts. Eighteen tokens now carry them,\neach a theme-file key. Both tables keep the old values, so no pixel\nchanges. The consts become functions that read the live token.\n\ntheme::with_alpha gives a token's own colour at an alpha, read\nunmultiplied, for the holder fills; ground_ink::facet_veil uses it too.\n\nThe colour-literal guard loses the ten rows of the tool family.\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
