      "message": "fix(ui): the tool drawing caches key on their theme inks\n\nThe tool list thumbnails and the holder outline keep their built shapes,\nand those shapes carry theme colours. A theme change kept the old\ncolours. Each cache key now holds the inks its shapes carry.\n\nPinned by a_theme_change_of_the_inks_builds_the_row_drawing_again and\na_theme_change_of_the_inks_builds_the_holder_outline_again.\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
