      "message": "refactor(ui): the verdict palettes are in the token table\n\nThe six colour-vision palettes and the house text inks move unchanged\nfrom colorvision.rs and ground_ink.rs into theme/verdict.rs. The names\nstay associated consts, so no call site changes. The colour-vision maths\nstays in colorvision.rs. No theme-file key sets a verdict colour.\n\nThe colour-literal guard drops the colorvision.rs row and keeps the new\ntable. Pinned by each_colour_vision_palette_keeps_its_values_in_the_token_table\nand no_theme_key_sets_a_verdict_colour.\n\nRefs #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
