      "message": "refactor(ui): the window close button inks are theme tokens\n\nclose_hover and close_ink join Tokens and the theme-file colour keys,\nwith the old values in both columns. The error_text guard row was its\ninline test module's Color32::RED, not a draw site: the tests move to\nerror_text_tests.rs. The guard keeps only permanent rows, and a new test\nholds the colour vocabulary inside the theme map cap.\n\nPinned by the_built_in_columns_keep_the_close_button_colours,\neach_close_button_ink_is_a_theme_key and\nthe_colour_vocabulary_fits_the_map_cap.\n\nFixes #1120\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
